**On-device AI** means that AI (artificial intelligence) systems run locally on a user's device, like a smartphone or tablet. Instead of relying on external servers or the internet, these AI systems use the data the user has on their device. This means the AI models are trained on their own data, which can be used to improve or solve problems in real time. This approach is more efficient and can be more personalized for each user's specific use case.

